---
/**
 * Seamless integrations / compliance / support accordion — Figma node
 * 13600:29595 (".Container - How Cleartax helps").
 *
 * DUPLICATION, KNOWN: started as a byte-identical copy of
 * `global-homepage/Seamless.astro` (itself a copy of
 * `global-invoicing/Seamless.astro` differing only in the H2). Copied rather
 * than promoted to a `_shared` primitive because a page bundle only sources its
 * own section folder, and because shipping this page must not disturb the two
 * live embeds. The three have since diverged: the Service and Support panel here
 * is the France design (node 12621:12608), a six-card grid, where the other two
 * still carry the "360° Support" image panel. Folding them onto one primitive
 * now means making that panel a prop, not just moving the file.
 * Accordion selects one of four panels (compliance / integrations / security /
 * service and support).
 *
 * SERVICE AND SUPPORT ICONS are the Figma exports inlined as <svg>, unlike every
 * other icon in this section, which is a Webflow-hosted PNG. Inline is what makes
 * them work the moment this is pasted — a Figma asset URL dies in 7 days — but
 * six two-tone icons are ~16 KB of path data inside a 49 KB Embed budget, and
 * this section is at ~46 KB. Coordinates are rounded to 2dp (0.02px on a 32px
 * icon) which bought ~6 KB; there is no second trick like that available. The
 * next thing that needs room here should move these six to Webflow-hosted SVGs,
 * which drops the panel to ~1 KB. Until then, do not paste anything else in.
 *
 * Nothing below is dead-code tolerant either: an HTML comment ships to Webflow
 * as bytes, so commented-out markup was removed rather than left in place.
 */

